# Both spellings, and the bare one is the load-bearing half. A trailing slash
# matches a *directory* only, so in a git worktree — where `node_modules` is a
# symlink up to the parent checkout — the slashed form below does not match it
# and `git add -A` tracks a 120000 blob reading `../../../node_modules`. Merged,
# every clone and every CI runner gets a dangling path where the dependency tree
# belongs. Inherited from seekolous, where it had already been committed once.
node_modules
node_modules/
dist/
*.log
.DS_Store
.vite/
.scratch/
.pi/

# probe output: regenerated by scripts/shot-*.mjs, never reviewed as source
probe-shots/

# The canonical view set (#104): PNGs and the sheet built from them. Regenerated
# by `npm run views`, and deliberately not committed — a baseline in git would
# make drift visible for free, at the price of a binary-heavy diff on every
# visual PR and a repo that grows with each lever. Before/after is two runs at
# two refs instead, which costs nothing and keeps the pair honest.
view-set/

# Claude Code scratch: agent worktrees are checkouts, not content.
.claude/worktrees/
.worktrees/

# Claude Code: the shared allowlist is tracked so a fresh worktree gets it;
# per-machine preferences are not.
.claude/settings.local.json
# Swift Package Manager cache a tool leaves in a checkout (sage #368).
.build/

# The `gh` CLI's run-log cache, when a worktree points it at itself so a log can
# be read without write access to the user cache. Regenerated per `gh run view`,
# and a 214 KB zip of CI logs in history is permanent.
.gh-cache
.gh-cache/

# scratch instruments an agent drops beside the tree; never a shipped consumer of src/
.probe-tmp/

# The sound set (#552): WAVs and the listening page, one folder per label.
# Regenerated by `npm run sounds`, never committed, for the view set's reason.
sound-set/

# capture-sounds.mjs dependency cache (#552)
.vite-sounds/

# The neural voice prototype: model, voices and runtime, fetched at build
# time and never committed (about 280 MiB: two models, eight voices, two
# runtime binaries).
public/voice-model/
.voice-model-cache/

# The music's instrument samples (map #1's Constraints, 2026-10-06) are
# prepared by scripts/fetch-music-samples.mjs and tracked in Git LFS
# (.gitattributes). Only the sets the principal chose by ear are committed;
# the two that lost their blind auditions, and the script's index of whatever
# it last built, stay local. The download cache is outside the repository.
public/music-samples/piano-vcsl/
public/music-samples/harpsi-vcsl/
public/music-samples/index.json

# Dream Loop visual references and iteration captures
.dream-loop/
spikes/coriolis/*.blend1
spikes/courier-cockpit/*.blend1
spikes/porter-hull/*.blend1
spikes/longwall-miner/*.blend1
spikes/interiors/__pycache__/

# Scratch scripts, never a deliverable.
.tmp/
